        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu akwetu twakeŋa a, iwu himukanda wamuchiyedi wunidi nakuyisonekela. Munyikanda yejima yiyedi nalondi kuhizumwisha nachunyichima yenu yalala nakuyanukisha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda mwanuki mazu ahosheluwu dehi atuprofwetu ajila, nikuleja kwaMwanta yowu Chamwinu, kwahosheliyi mudi apostolu jenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambilenu kwiluka nenu hamafuku akukuminina kwakenza akwakuseha nakuseha, nakwila mwaya kufwila kwawu aweni kwatama; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, Indi kwinza kwindi kwakaniniyi kwokudihi? Muloŋa chochakaminuwu ankakulula tulu, yuma yejima chochiyekala, neyi chiyadiŋi hatachi haleŋeluwu yuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa kwonti kwawu kwanuka nawu mawulu adiŋi kwoku chachikulu, niiseki datuŋilewi nameji mukachi kameji, nezu daNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpata yamunu mwishina yadiŋuku yajiminini mumeji, yanoŋeli nezu odu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakwinza mawulu niiseki aduku katataka, anayiswekeli kesi nezu dodimu, anayiswekeli ifuku dakusompesha nikujilumuka kwawantu asekeshaŋa Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila enu akwetu twakeŋa a, bayi muvulamena ichichuma chimuku, Yehova wamonaŋa ifuku dimu didi neyi ikombakaji danyaka, niikombakaji danyaka didi neyi ifuku dimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta halabaŋa kwila chuma chakaniniyi, neyi chatenaŋawu antu kulabaku, ilaŋa hakudiwunjika nenu, hanakeŋi muntu niwumu kunoŋaku, nakeŋi antu ejima abalumuki munyichima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa ifuku daYehova dakenza neyi chenzaŋa ikombi; denodu ifuku mawulu akahita nalushindu lwalweni, niyuma yejima yakasuŋunuka neyena dakesi, niiseki niyuma yidumu yakasukuma bwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu chineli yumiyi yejima yakasuŋunuka chochichi, shakamenu nakujila nakwakama Nzambi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakutalila nakukeŋa nankashi chakenza ifuku daNzambi dakasuŋunuka mawulu hakabutukawu kesi, dakasuŋunuka yuma yejima neyena dakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila etu twatalilaŋa mawulu amaha niiseki dadiha, mwakekala kuloŋa neyi chakaniniyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi enu akwetu twakeŋa a, chimwatalilaŋa yumiyi, dikwatishenu kulonda akayiwani munashakami chachiwahi zo-o, chakadi ihuji, nákubula hakuyinkela Muloŋa kumesu indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toŋojokenu nenu chakubula yi Mwanta kuzuwa swayi hiwamwinu; mwomwayisonekeleliyi nimana kwetu Pawulu twakeŋa a, nama ana amwinkeluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watenaŋa yumiyi munyikanda yindi yejima; mudi niyuma yi kwawu yakala kwiluka, yenoyu antu akadi maana nikukola ayiheŋeshaŋi, neyi chaheŋeshaŋawu nyikanda yajila yi kwawu, hiyakudikisaŋana awenawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi enu akwetu twakeŋa i, chimuneli mweluka dehi, babalenu mubuli kuhuŋumuka nakuluwaŋesha kwawantu atama, mubuli kufuma mukukola kwenwenu aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulenu muluwi nimukumwiluka Mwanta wetu Chamwinu Yesu Kristu. Kulema kwikali kwindi nikatataka nihaya nyaka. Amena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
